VALUES
('11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111127',NULL,'Verified local resident',2,'The record says done in 2018 but the left edge has broken away and there is a sunken patch outside the petrol pump.','The record says done in 2018 but the left edge has broken away and there is a sunken patch outside the petrol pump.','clean','visible','Nothing flagged.',true,'poor'),
('11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111127',NULL,'ramesh',2,'Water stands here for two days after any rain. Autos avoid this stretch completely in the monsoon.','Water stands here for two days after any rain. Autos avoid this stretch completely in the monsoon.','clean','visible','Nothing flagged.',false,'poor'),
('11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111123',NULL,'Verified local resident',5,'The port road is smooth and the approach lighting works. Big change for people living nearby.','The port road is smooth and the approach lighting works. Big change for people living nearby.','clean','visible','Nothing flagged.',true,'good'),
('11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111117',NULL,'meena',3,'The ring road itself is fine but the service road on the eastern side is still gravel in places.','The ring road itself is fine but the service road on the eastern side is still gravel in places.','clean','visible','Nothing flagged.',false,'mixed');